as well as software and domain name registrations, the protection of which is important to our reputation and the continued growth of
our business. Below is a comprehensive summary of our intellectual property rights.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">As of September 30, 2025, we
had registered six trademarks in Macau, two trademarks in HK and one trademark in USA.</p>

