<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
industrial park consultation services industry in China sees increased competition, primarily due to the on-going regulatory reforms,
rapid technological innovation, evolving industry standards, and increasing demand for higher levels of client experience. The market
is relatively fragmented as estimated there were over 1,000 market participants in the industrial park consultation services industry
in China.</span></p>

