<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Group purchases social security fund for its employees, who are entitled to receive various benefits including pension, disability benefits,
unemployment benefits, sickness benefits, maternity benefits, marriage benefits, and funeral benefits in accordance with the law. This
provides basic social security for residents, especially elderly care, to improve their quality of life.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

