<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 17.85pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
regulatory environment for the corporate and industrial park related services in Mainland China and Macau from time to time is evolving
in order to govern the related sector. We have been closely tracking the development and implementation of new rules and regulations
likely to affect us. We will continue to ensure timely compliance with any new rules and regulations and believe that such timely compliance
is essential to our growth. To the extent that we may be required to adapt our operations to new laws and regulations, our operating
costs may increase which will impact our profitability.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 17.85pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Key
Components of Results of Operations</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

