<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>&#160;</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 17.85pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
revenues consist of administrative services fees, fintech services fees, investment brokerage fees, project brokerage fees, project research
fees and interest income and others. The following table sets forth the breakdown of our total revenues, both in absolute amount and
as a percentage of our total revenues, for the periods presented:</span></p>

