(loss) gain</i> &#8212; Exchange (loss) gain increased from exchange loss US$54 for the year ended September 30, 2023 to exchange gain
US$7,618 for the year ended September 30, 2024 mainly because of the appreciation of CNY.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

