costs </i>&#8212; Occupancy costs decreased by 3.1% from US$95,263 for the year ended September 30, 2023 to US$92,294 for the year ended
September 30, 2024, primarily due to more favourable office rent terms secured under a new tenancy agreement entered in January 2023.</span></p>

