fulfilling their duty of care to us, our directors must ensure compliance with our memorandum and articles of association as may be amended
from time to time. Our company has a right to seek damages against any director who breaches a duty owed to us.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

